  "address_note": "gov.uk 'Check which driving test centres you can move your test to' (updated 15 October 2026, read 2026-11-21) lists Chertsey (London) as a current centre (Guildford about 11 miles away); the find-driving-test-centre service could not be reached from this machine. The address is DVSA's centre data as quoted on passrates.uk (DVSA find a driving test centre, captured 2026-05-12, OGL), matched by driveJohnson's Chertsey page; pass 1 records 8,669 tests a year, so the centre is open here. OSM has the Hanworth Lane Business Park (way/249586559) at the given position, with a KT16 9JX building (way/249586562) 29 m from it; the units are not named on the map, so which building is Unit 4 is not shown. The park is reached from Hanworth Lane (the service road, way/162180630) by an unnamed way in (way/162180659) and from The Knoll; Hanworth Lane's residential part (way/162180626) runs north to Guildford Road but is cut off from the park at its south end. Matches. Recheck on the gov.uk centre finder when reachable.",
